    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Distorted grids",
      "links": [],
      "level": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Christoph Brachmann and Romana Walter: \"Rastersturz.\nInteraktive Auseinandersetzung mit einer Grafik von Georg Nees.\" In: Lutz Dickmann, Lars Fehr, Susanne Grabowski, Philipp Kehl, Frieder\nNake, Romana Walter (eds.):\nDer Bericht zum Projekt macS. (Mediating Art in Computational\nSpaces.) Universität Bremen Medieninformatik (B.Sc.) January\n2004.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Der Bericht zum Projekt macS. (Mediating Art in Computational Spaces.)",
          "href": "http://laurie.informatik.uni-bremen.de/blog/malte/archives/macS%20Projektbericht.pdf",
          "external": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Jochem\nvan der Spek No Noise 2001",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Jochem van der Spek",
          "href": "http://www.xs4all.nl/%7Evdspek/",
          "external": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Bit-101\nLaboratory: 01 sep 01; 01 oct 23/29; 01 nov 04/06-08; 01 dec\n24; 02 jan 30/31; 02 oct 04; 02 mar 02/12; 02 may 11; 02 sep 12/13.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Bit-101 Laboratory",
          "href": "http://www.bit-101.com/base.html",
          "external": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Projected grids",
      "links": [],
      "level": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/algorithmic-art/grid/minimal/empty/mc-donough-mcdonough-grid2-S.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "Michael McDonough: Grid\nHouse, Boston, MA, 1978.",
      "width": "150",
      "height": "214",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Grid House,",
          "href": "http://www.michaelmcdonough.com/Gridhouse/gridhouse.htm",
          "external": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "To add:",
      "links": [],
      "level": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "François Morellet:",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"2 trames 0°, 90°\",\n1971.\n\n\"2 doubles trames 30°, 60°\", 1971.\n\n\"1 double trames 0°\", 1973.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "François Morellet: Exhibition\nCatalogue Nationalgalerie Berlin, 1977, pp. 138-144.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Also: Man Ray photos?",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "To add:",
      "links": [],
      "level": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Ellsworth Kelly: White Panels\non Green (1950), Bathroom Tiles (1951), Two Yellows (1952), Red\nand White (1952), White and Black (1952)",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "[Yve-Alain Bois: Ellsworth Kelly: The Early Drawings,\n1948-1955. Cambridge, Mass.: Harvard University Art Museums, 1999,\n# 37, 117-121.]",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"You know, what I wanted was really abstract. Can't be about\nnature, or this world. (Pause.) We have a lot of really abstract\nemotions not caused by anything in this world. You can wake up\nin the morning and you are happy. Extraordinarily happy with no\ntraceable cause. That's an abstract experience. There's a whole\nrange of delicate emotions that nobody pays any attention to.\nI hope when people look at my paintings – and they're just horizontal\nlines – but they do respond to my work. Even though it's so simple,\nthey respond emotionally. And they see that it's happy. And there's\na very delicate emotion called tranquility. When you stop, and\nyou rest, and come to an absolute stop. And that's when tranquility\ntakes over.\"",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Agnes Martin. Interview by Tom Collins: AGNES\nMARTIN REFLECTS ON ART & LIFE. Geronimo 2,\n1 (January 1999)",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "AGNES MARTIN REFLECTS ON ART & LIFE.",
          "href": "http://taoswebb.com/geronimo/january99/visualart.html",
          "external": true
        }
      ]
    }
